Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?HTDESIGNER-56:=20=E5=85=A8=E9=83=A8=E6=94=B9?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=9B=9E=20of=20an=20AutoSize=3DFalse=20pattern=20gives=20each?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20label=20its=20own=20.dfm=20size=20(0.56.0)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

R48 made a single reset of an AutoSize=False label bring the .dfm's own
size, but the pattern line's 全部改回 (DfmDiffPanel.resetPattern) built its
items from type / prop / value only, so a whole pattern of such labels got
the sizes their text makes instead. It now carries each row's size, the same
way lib/dfmdiff.resetItemsOf does.

Test: smoke (a pattern of two AutoSize=False labels -> one editMany with 136 x
24 and 39 x 16, each its own).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/CHANGELOG.md            |  3 +++
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js            |  3 ++-
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/package.json            |  2 +-
 tools/vscode-htdesigner/test/smoke_extension.js | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/CHANGELOG.md b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/CHANGELOG.md
index 4690cd0..6630636 100644
--- a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,9 @@
 
 每一版多了什麼。怎麼操作看 [操作一覽](CHEATSHEET.md)，詳細說明看 README。
 
+## 0.56.0
+- 修正：差異清單「同一種差異 → 全部改回」遇到 AutoSize=False 的 Label，現在每個都用它自己在 DFM 的寬高（以前會用文字的大小）。
+
 ## 0.55.0
 - 屬性面板多了 Label 的 **Alignment**（靠左／置中／靠右），會跟 DFM 比對。
 - 「改回 DFM」遇到 BCB6 是 **AutoSize=False** 的 Label，會直接用 DFM 的寬高（不是文字的大小），加上 Alignment，一次就跟 BCB6 一樣。
diff --git a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js
index c085f77..290d349 100644
--- a/tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js
+++ b/tools/vscode-htdesigner/extension.js
@@ -3129,7 +3129,8 @@ class DfmDiffPanel {
         '（寫進 HTML 原始碼，一個 Ctrl+Z 全部復原；要存檔才寫入）', { modal: true }, '改回');
       if (pick !== '改回') return null;
     }
-    const items = rows.map(r => ({ id: r.id, type: r.reset.type, prop: r.reset.prop, value: r.reset.value }));
+    // (AutoSize = False: each label's own .dfm size comes along -- lib/dfmdiff.resetItemsOf does the same)
+    const items = rows.map(r => Object.assign({ id: r.id, type: r.reset.type, prop: r.reset.prop, value: r.reset.value }, r.reset.size ? { size: r.reset.size } : {}));
     this.d.panel.reveal(this.d.panel.viewColumn, true);
     this.d.post({ type: 'editMany', items });
     vscode.window.setStatusBarMessage('$(discard) ' + rows.length + ' 個 ' + pat.cls + ' 的 ' + pat.prop + ' 改回 DFM 的值（Ctrl+Z 復原）', 6000);
